            </note>
            <note corresp="#d58-f3" n="3" xml:id="d58-f3-content">
                <p>Under his signature, Carter wrote, “p.s. I will be writing you soon, prior to the
                    visit of Sec. Vance, to outline peace negotiation prospects. J.C.”</p>
            </note>
